  "description": "Song Da-Na is a planning PD of a webtoon production company and a makeup YouTuber with 240,000 subscribers. During a makeup live for a movie, her boyfriend suddenly comes to her house and shows her shocking appearance. With a sore head from the aftereffects of a breakup, a hangover, and even rude coworkers who rush at her as soon as she gets to work, her team junior, Kim Seok-Jin, showcases her videos during a meeting and announces that he will plan a webtoon centered around YouTubers ! \n\n\"Did he do it on purpose because he knew it was me ?\"\n\nShe gets really drunk and ends up confessing her double life to him. The next day, Seok-Jin blackmail her to cooperate on the project.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**       \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65780593), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%98%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%BC%EC%BD%94%EB%A5%BC-%EB%8F%84%EC%99%80%EC%A4%98/4373)\n\n**Official Translations:**      \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/179895)",
